  "findings": [
    "Across all tested checkpoint/budget combinations, mean original canonical Model3 central response slopes were lower than a posthoc one-parameter directional full-Mendelian comparator with identical unperturbed expected assurance frequency and identical starting heterozygote.",
    "The same-background symmetric design removes a distinct-genotype selection confound present in separate high-to-low and low-to-high one-copy perturbation experiments.",
    "All source-state baseline q and genotype-copy changes are exact finite Model3 mathematical kernel calculations; the ensemble averages and MC SEs are conditional on one archived visitor history.",
    "Comparability collapses near fixation, particularly budget3 year8 (23/128 states); apparent time amplification is selection on nonfixed surviving source states and cannot be generalized to fixed states.",
    "The local response difference is not a uniquely causal selection coefficient, ecological stabilizing feedback proof, independent history or eight-year variance regulation proof. The matched directional null is intentionally different reproductive biology and tuned on the original state."
